WEBVTT

00:00.580 --> 00:04.250
Do you like Big Sis Alice?

00:04.250 --> 00:09.880
Do you?

00:10.710 --> 00:13.630
I'm in a situation where
I can't move at all.

00:13.630 --> 00:15.050
Exactly...

00:15.640 --> 00:16.710
Like this one.

00:16.710 --> 00:18.010
(Rumble)
Like this one.

00:18.010 --> 00:19.140
(Rumble)

00:19.140 --> 00:24.020
I escaped to this place to evade
everyone's questions.

00:24.020 --> 00:27.270
But somehow they all followed me here!

00:27.270 --> 00:30.480
Talk about things getting south.

00:31.280 --> 00:33.400
Hey, do you like her?

00:33.400 --> 00:35.280
Well, uh...

00:35.280 --> 00:36.870
I, uh...

00:36.870 --> 00:39.240
Ein, no running away!

00:39.240 --> 00:42.540
Yeah, yeah! We demand an answer!

00:43.290 --> 00:48.750
Good grief. You can't just force
an answer from him.

00:48.750 --> 00:50.300
Fine...

00:50.300 --> 00:52.380
I'm saved...

00:52.380 --> 00:55.050
But now there's another problem...

00:55.840 --> 00:58.300
Honestly, in this situation...

00:58.300 --> 01:00.760
I don't know where to look!

01:01.310 --> 01:03.810
On top of that...

01:03.810 --> 01:06.520
Why are you sitting on my lap, Pina?!

01:07.060 --> 01:11.320
Oh my, Mister!
Your face is as red as a lobster.

01:11.320 --> 01:12.820
Could it be...

01:12.820 --> 01:17.570
That you're weak in the knees
from my soft curves?

01:17.570 --> 01:18.940
That's relieving to hear.

01:18.940 --> 01:23.330
I worried that you had a fever
seeing how red your face is.

01:23.330 --> 01:27.830
I admire how naturally
clueless you can be.

01:27.830 --> 01:31.880
Phew, so this is a sauna, huh?

01:31.880 --> 01:34.920
It sure feels nice sweating this much.

01:36.590 --> 01:38.140
I'm at my limit.

01:38.140 --> 01:40.970
Need to go out, sorry.

01:44.310 --> 01:45.480
Alice?

01:45.480 --> 01:48.190
Hey, are you okay?
You should get out.

01:48.190 --> 01:51.190
I'm fine...
I want to stay here.

01:51.190 --> 01:55.780
I, too, can do as much as everyone here.

01:55.780 --> 01:57.490
You don't have to push yourself.

01:58.200 --> 02:00.120
I'm not pushing myself...

02:00.580 --> 02:03.120
What I want is...

02:03.120 --> 02:07.000
To be able to stay with you...

02:07.000 --> 02:09.370
...forever and ever.

02:10.210 --> 02:11.630
Alice...

02:12.630 --> 02:14.380
Yay!

02:14.380 --> 02:18.180
So you want to go on adventures
together forever, right?

02:18.180 --> 02:20.590
I want to stay with you too, Big Sis.

02:21.140 --> 02:26.140
Of course she'd want to stay together
with her family now that they're reunited.

02:26.140 --> 02:27.890
Oh, geez...

02:27.890 --> 02:31.360
Poor Alice. It seems that what
she was confessin'...

02:31.360 --> 02:34.570
...didn't get through to him.

02:36.150 --> 02:40.570
Ursula, please begin the process
of modifying Alice's spirit core.

02:40.570 --> 02:41.780
Sure.

02:41.780 --> 02:43.910
Oh, in that case, take this too.

02:44.430 --> 02:46.500
This is my Sage's Stone.

02:46.500 --> 02:49.790
As Alice's mother,
I want to lend you my strength too.

02:50.710 --> 02:55.510
I can't physically teleport there to help,
but my abilities should still be useful.

02:56.300 --> 02:58.550
All right, kneel down, Ein.

02:58.550 --> 02:59.570
Okay.

03:00.840 --> 03:01.970
(Mirage Double (SSS) — Creates a clone from
Suzaku's flames, which can be altered.)

03:01.970 --> 03:03.550
(Thousand Mile Eye (SSS)
Sees distant events.)

03:04.140 --> 03:07.810
I'll be in your care from...

03:17.420 --> 03:19.990
Compared to what I read in books...

03:19.990 --> 03:21.110
Wow.

03:21.110 --> 03:22.070
Oh my.

03:22.070 --> 03:24.990
Huh, I thought this would be
way more impressive.

03:30.120 --> 03:35.090
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

03:35.090 --> 03:39.920
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle♪

03:39.920 --> 03:49.680
(Even Given the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,
I'm Actually the Strongest)

03:49.680 --> 03:54.440
♪A fleeting dream I had is falling now♪

03:54.440 --> 03:58.820
♪The loneliness remains as my power♪

03:59.690 --> 04:03.610
♪To a life that is drifting away♪

04:03.610 --> 04:06.830
♪The magic sprinkles upon♪

04:08.240 --> 04:13.000
♪I pick up the fragments
and tightly tether them♪

04:13.000 --> 04:17.670
♪I always keep them as
my source of strength in my heart♪

04:17.670 --> 04:19.920
♪See the world through my eyes♪

04:19.920 --> 04:22.260
♪And you'll get your treasure♪

04:22.260 --> 04:27.760
♪Let's go around the world and find it out♪

04:28.970 --> 04:33.350
♪I'm not going to lose,
because I believe in myself♪

04:33.810 --> 04:38.480
♪Everything's possible
I've overcome a lot so far♪

04:38.480 --> 04:43.360
♪Because you have given it to me♪

04:43.360 --> 04:50.160
♪I'll do whatever it takes
to protect that miracle, for good♪

05:01.920 --> 05:04.010
Well, then. What's next...

05:04.010 --> 05:05.130
Ein.

05:05.130 --> 05:06.510
Miss Meegan?

05:06.510 --> 05:09.430
Oh? You've gotten even stronger.

05:09.430 --> 05:13.020
You've really grown, young man.

05:13.020 --> 05:18.770
However, you can still always run into
my arms and rely on me anytime.

05:20.020 --> 05:22.150
What's this all about?

05:23.530 --> 05:27.820
A direct request from the king
came to the guild today.

05:27.820 --> 05:29.570
His Majesty? To me?

05:29.570 --> 05:30.410
Yes.

05:30.410 --> 05:33.330
Are you familiar
with the demon race?

05:33.330 --> 05:34.410
Demon race?

05:34.630 --> 05:39.580
I am a fifth-rank noble of the demon
aristocracy, Baron Falco of the Gale!

05:39.580 --> 05:40.920
I am.

05:40.920 --> 05:44.970
They were supposed to have been banished
from the human realm centuries ago...

05:44.970 --> 05:47.590
...with a dimensional barrier
created by the hero.

05:47.590 --> 05:53.350
However, demons have been
appearing in Rayshik territory.

05:53.350 --> 05:58.270
You're requested to eliminate
those rampaging demons.

05:58.270 --> 06:01.690
We can't allow
any more casualties.

06:01.690 --> 06:05.110
Besides, no ordinary adventurer
can fight the demon race.

06:05.110 --> 06:08.610
This is a request only
you can handle, young man.

06:10.120 --> 06:12.580
Everyone, listen to me.

06:12.580 --> 06:15.370
I want to help
the people of Rayshik.

06:16.200 --> 06:19.830
Ein, we have our own mission.

06:19.830 --> 06:21.380
Why help these strangers?

06:21.380 --> 06:27.380
Didn't you both help me,
a stranger, when we first met?

06:29.380 --> 06:35.020
I know very well the fear and despair of
facing enemies beyond your strength.

06:35.640 --> 06:38.020
That's what I always felt after all.

06:39.140 --> 06:44.020
It's because you both saved me back then
I can become who I am now.

06:44.020 --> 06:49.030
That's why I want to be exactly
how you both were to me.

06:49.030 --> 06:52.240
I share the sentiment with you.

06:52.240 --> 06:54.740
Let's help those in need together!

06:54.740 --> 06:56.370
Sounds good to me!

06:56.370 --> 06:58.040
I'm with you, Einsy.

06:58.040 --> 07:00.290
If that's your wish.

07:00.290 --> 07:01.630
Ursula...

07:03.420 --> 07:07.170
If Yuri wants to do it,
then I have no reason to object.

07:07.800 --> 07:11.930
Jasper, Miss Meegan,
I'll take the request.

07:15.850 --> 07:19.770
I'll defeat the demons
in Rayshik territory!

07:24.190 --> 07:27.400
Dad, I'm hungry.

07:27.400 --> 07:30.200
Just a little longer, Mia.

07:30.200 --> 07:35.160
We'll soon arrive at a place
where you can eat a lot.

07:35.160 --> 07:37.450
Really? Yay!

07:37.450 --> 07:41.210
Is it like the heaven where Mommy went?

07:42.750 --> 07:44.210
I suppose so...

07:49.300 --> 07:50.720
Is this the place?

07:53.720 --> 07:56.720
Everyone, Lord Hydra has arrived!

07:56.720 --> 07:58.680
Bow down!

07:59.220 --> 08:01.730
Huh? Who's Lord Hydra?

08:01.730 --> 08:04.480
A serpent god
that protects our village.

08:05.310 --> 08:06.980
A god?

08:10.490 --> 08:13.360
Go, bring forth the sacrifice.

08:15.030 --> 08:17.490
Mia, go on ahead.

08:17.990 --> 08:22.500
That god will take you to heaven.

08:22.500 --> 08:24.370
Okay! Got it.

08:24.370 --> 08:27.500
I can't go with you
right now, but...

08:27.500 --> 08:31.510
I'll catch up soon.
Wait there with Mommy, okay?

08:32.770 --> 08:35.260
When Mommy went to heaven...

08:35.260 --> 08:39.260
You cried every single day, right?

08:39.260 --> 08:44.270
Promise me, that you won't cry
even after I go to heaven, okay?

08:44.270 --> 08:50.280
Because I won't be with you
to wipe your tears anymore.

08:50.280 --> 08:54.280
Mia, so you... understand?

08:54.280 --> 08:55.530
See you...

08:57.410 --> 08:59.910
You're late, humans!

08:59.910 --> 09:03.660
Is this all? After all that waiting
you've made us?

09:03.660 --> 09:06.080
My, she looks delicious.

09:06.080 --> 09:07.420
I'm hungry.

09:07.420 --> 09:10.630
L-Lord Hydra...

09:10.630 --> 09:13.590
Please, take me to heaven.

09:13.590 --> 09:16.680
No, don't! I can't let her go!

09:16.680 --> 09:17.800
Daddy?

09:17.800 --> 09:19.510
What nonsense are you spouting?

09:19.510 --> 09:21.810
Didn't we agree to this?!

09:21.810 --> 09:24.770
This is the only way for
the village to survive!

09:24.770 --> 09:29.060
Then take me! Please take me
instead of my daughter!

09:29.060 --> 09:31.570
Please! Please take me!

09:31.570 --> 09:33.190
I hate men.

09:33.190 --> 09:36.450
I'll eat all the men,
so no problem.

09:36.450 --> 09:38.070
Women only.

09:38.070 --> 09:42.540
You humans. We've had an agreement.

09:42.540 --> 09:47.670
We won't destroy your village
for one woman per month.

09:47.670 --> 09:50.840
Break that promise,
then you'll leave us with no choice.

09:50.840 --> 09:54.840
No! Just hand over
your daughter already!

09:54.840 --> 09:59.300
You're all in grave crime for
displeasing us. Our verdict is...

09:59.300 --> 10:00.850
Execution!

10:04.350 --> 10:07.000
Is this what a god is?

10:08.900 --> 10:11.730
Well then, time to dig in!

10:13.480 --> 10:16.240
Anyone, please... Save me!

10:23.790 --> 10:26.080
A god?

10:27.000 --> 10:30.630
That's a Hydra.
An SS-ranked Ancient Dragon.

10:30.630 --> 10:33.090
It has Poison Creation.

10:33.090 --> 10:36.340
It can generate all kinds of
medicines and toxins.

10:36.340 --> 10:37.590
Got it.

10:37.590 --> 10:39.300
Yuri, I'm counting on you.

10:39.300 --> 10:40.230
Yes!

10:46.020 --> 10:46.990
Huh?

10:46.990 --> 10:49.730
Daddy! Thank goodness!

10:49.730 --> 10:54.070
What? You purified our
poison just by staring at us?!

10:54.070 --> 10:55.730
Impossible!

10:55.730 --> 10:59.780
Since my Divine Eye got powered up,
Yuri's healing got even stronger.

10:59.780 --> 11:01.490
This is incredible!

11:01.970 --> 11:05.620
I'll handle Hydra.
Everyone, please run!

11:05.620 --> 11:08.000
What about you, then?

11:08.000 --> 11:13.500
You heard them! I don't know who you are,
but nothing will change...

11:13.500 --> 11:15.500
...with a mere human.

11:15.500 --> 11:19.010
A sword?
It's no match against our poison.

11:19.010 --> 11:21.120
Go ahead and try pulling it out!

11:24.930 --> 11:26.260
Drawing Strike.

11:31.730 --> 11:33.900
Wait! I remember him!

11:34.340 --> 11:37.130
He's the Ancient Dragon Slayer
from the royal capital,

11:37.130 --> 11:38.650
The legendary hero Lord Ein!

11:38.650 --> 11:42.730
You imbued your sword with Yuri's
purification to nullify the poison,

11:42.730 --> 11:44.570
landing a clean strike.

11:44.570 --> 11:45.580
Good call.

11:45.580 --> 11:47.410
Heh. I guess so.

11:47.410 --> 11:50.910
Did Ursula actually praise me?!

11:50.910 --> 11:54.580
(Badump)
I have appraised its Poison Creation
and Cleansing Wipe.

11:54.580 --> 11:54.670
(Badump)
R-Roger. Thank you.

11:54.670 --> 11:56.720
R-Roger. Thank you.

11:57.340 --> 12:00.090
Lord Ein! Thank you very much!

12:00.090 --> 12:02.180
You saved us!

12:02.180 --> 12:04.010
Thank you, God!

12:04.010 --> 12:06.800
No need to thank me.
I just did what was right.

12:07.310 --> 12:10.560
So, I'd like to meet
the lord of this place...

12:13.560 --> 12:16.060
Huh? Why the sudden
change in attitude?

12:16.060 --> 12:18.730
We are grateful for your help.

12:18.730 --> 12:23.070
If you hadn't come,
we would have all been killed...

12:23.070 --> 12:26.570
But, perhaps it would've
been better that way.

12:26.570 --> 12:27.910
Huh?

12:27.910 --> 12:30.080
Come on, let's go home.

12:36.330 --> 12:37.600
Dear God!

12:38.090 --> 12:41.340
I'm so thankful that you saved me!

12:41.340 --> 12:44.840
Really, really thankful!

12:48.220 --> 12:52.770
Thank you.
I'm not a deity or anything.

12:52.770 --> 12:55.600
I just want to protect everyone's smile.

12:55.600 --> 12:59.020
No deities will ever beat me
on that sentiment alone.

13:01.480 --> 13:03.860
All right then, be careful
on your way home.

13:03.860 --> 13:06.360
Yep! See you later, God!

13:09.370 --> 13:12.000
Now, then. Time to meet their lord.

13:14.460 --> 13:16.750
So this is the lord's mansion.

13:16.750 --> 13:19.380
Something fishy is
definitely going on.

13:19.380 --> 13:22.260
This is only the place
that's too grand.

13:22.260 --> 13:26.840
I agree. Who knows what's inside,
so get into the eye, everyone.

13:26.840 --> 13:27.800
Understood.

13:29.930 --> 13:32.970
Excuse me, my name is Ein.

13:32.970 --> 13:35.140
I was dispatched here by the guild.

13:35.140 --> 13:37.650
Well, well, Sir Ein.

13:37.650 --> 13:42.400
It's my honor to meet the hero,
the Ancient Dragon Slayer himself.

13:42.940 --> 13:46.820
I am Nigun. Nigun Von Rayshik.

13:48.780 --> 13:49.820
Help yourself.

13:49.820 --> 13:53.200
These are sweets I made,
along with some tea I brewed.

13:53.200 --> 13:55.830
Thank you very much.
I'll have some.

13:57.920 --> 14:00.080
Salty!

14:00.080 --> 14:02.130
Does it suit your taste?

14:02.130 --> 14:07.340
It's delightful.
Rather... original, I'd say.

14:07.340 --> 14:09.050
Glad to hear that.

14:11.820 --> 14:15.930
I'm sorry, it seems
I mixed up the salt and sugar...

14:15.930 --> 14:17.600
How cliché.

14:17.600 --> 14:21.310
I've always been clumsy
no matter what I do.

14:22.570 --> 14:28.110
I'd like to ask you about the recent surge
of demons around here, if I may.

14:28.110 --> 14:32.120
Demons? I haven't seen them
around this territory.

14:32.740 --> 14:37.710
This territory borders the Abysswood,
home to many monsters,

14:37.710 --> 14:40.630
so the rumors might've been exaggerated.

14:40.630 --> 14:44.590
So, you're saying people
mistook monsters for demons?

14:44.590 --> 14:48.630
Yes. I apologize for making
you come all this way.

14:48.630 --> 14:53.350
Please inform the guild that
this territory is safe.

14:53.350 --> 14:57.600
Just in case, would it be all right
if I patrolled the area?

14:57.600 --> 15:01.100
The people in the territory seem
to be struggling in various ways.

15:01.100 --> 15:05.110
On my way here,
I even took down a Hydra,

15:05.110 --> 15:06.360
as well as the food...

15:07.740 --> 15:10.070
You took down the Hydra?

15:11.110 --> 15:17.120
What have you done?! The village will be
exposed to monsters' threat once again.

15:17.120 --> 15:18.250
What?

15:18.750 --> 15:25.380
The village is close to Hydra's territory,
it kept the other monsters away!

15:25.380 --> 15:28.630
But the Hydra was demanding sacrifices!

15:28.630 --> 15:33.890
Were we supposed to just
let a child be eaten today?!

15:34.640 --> 15:38.220
If sacrificing one person
can save a hundred,

15:38.220 --> 15:39.770
then so be it.

15:39.770 --> 15:44.400
Or else, do you want to stay
and protect us here forever?

15:45.270 --> 15:49.940
You might think that it's over
once you defeat an enemy before you.

15:49.940 --> 15:55.280
Not us! We must continue to
live here even after you leave.

15:55.280 --> 15:58.790
Not everyone is as strong as you.

15:58.790 --> 16:00.560
Besides...

16:01.810 --> 16:06.290
I am responsible for protecting
Rayshik after my father.

16:06.290 --> 16:09.800
For that, I will do whatever it takes.

16:11.170 --> 16:14.180
Pardon me, but I must take my leave.

16:17.970 --> 16:20.680
Did I do wrong?

16:20.680 --> 16:22.790
I didn't understand
what was going on here.

16:23.560 --> 16:27.400
But sacrificing one
to save a hundred?

16:28.150 --> 16:29.570
That's just...

16:32.070 --> 16:38.450
Ein, I don't get complicated things,
but there's one thing I do understand.

16:38.450 --> 16:42.810
You can just follow
the path you believe in.

16:42.810 --> 16:45.460
That is surely
what matters the most.

16:45.460 --> 16:46.710
Yuri...

16:50.590 --> 16:53.410
We have a problem!
Hydra has been defeated!

16:53.420 --> 16:55.380
We need to replace it fast!

16:55.380 --> 16:59.850
What do I do?
Tell me what to do, Shadow!

16:59.850 --> 17:01.600
Calm down, Nigun.

17:01.600 --> 17:04.730
There are plenty of
replacements for Hydra.

17:04.730 --> 17:06.400
The real problem is Ein.

17:06.400 --> 17:08.610
Sir Ein? Why?

17:09.110 --> 17:10.570
Think about it.

17:10.570 --> 17:15.610
Do you really think there's anyone
who can kill an SS-ranked Ancient Dragon?

17:15.610 --> 17:17.620
There's no way.

17:17.620 --> 17:20.130
He's no human.

17:20.130 --> 17:22.330
He's of the demon race.

17:22.330 --> 17:23.370
No way!

17:23.370 --> 17:25.870
If you truly want to protect Rayshik...

17:25.870 --> 17:29.130
You have no choice but to kill Ein.

17:29.130 --> 17:32.210
Kill him? That's...

17:32.210 --> 17:36.510
Have I ever misled you with my advice?

17:36.510 --> 17:39.640
I'm your friend, Nigun.

17:39.640 --> 17:42.520
Can't you trust me?

17:42.520 --> 17:44.520
I understand, Shadow...

17:45.200 --> 17:47.270
Let's kill him!

17:48.150 --> 17:50.440
Thank you as always, Shadow.

17:50.440 --> 17:51.610
Of course.

17:54.750 --> 17:58.240
Weak-willed humans are just
so easy to manipulate.

17:58.240 --> 18:00.280
It saves me time.

18:00.280 --> 18:04.290
Just a little more, Nigun.
Step by step.

18:04.290 --> 18:08.920
And then I, Viscount Shadow
the demon aristocrat,

18:08.920 --> 18:12.170
shall take over your body.

18:12.170 --> 18:16.420
My cute little friend!

18:19.430 --> 18:23.350
Good grief, the outer walls
are in shambles.

18:23.350 --> 18:26.930
Looks like they've been left
this way for years, too.

18:27.350 --> 18:30.020
No a single soldier was stationed
in the guard tower.

18:30.020 --> 18:32.190
So monsters can just
come and go freely?

18:32.190 --> 18:33.270
Yeah...

18:35.040 --> 18:36.200
Excuse me.

18:37.190 --> 18:41.160
Uh, my name is Ein, and
I was dispatched here by the guild.

18:41.160 --> 18:43.030
About this territory and the lord...

18:43.030 --> 18:44.700
I-I don't know!

18:45.100 --> 18:46.620
Again?

18:46.620 --> 18:48.210
Just like last time.

18:48.750 --> 18:51.330
Could it be that
they're afraid of Nigun?

18:51.330 --> 18:54.920
But I can't back down now.

18:54.920 --> 18:56.090
If I do...

18:56.710 --> 18:58.590
I can't save their smile.

18:59.220 --> 19:00.840
Excuse me.

19:00.840 --> 19:02.680
Uh, could I ask you something?

19:02.680 --> 19:04.220
Oh, it's you.

19:04.220 --> 19:06.680
There's nothing to talk about.

19:06.680 --> 19:13.810
Adventurers and soldiers have come
and gone only for nothing and left us.

19:13.810 --> 19:15.480
You're no different.

19:15.480 --> 19:16.780
That's not true.

19:16.780 --> 19:18.150
Look at this field.

19:18.740 --> 19:22.820
The moment the Hydra was gone,
monsters came and ravaged it.

19:24.240 --> 19:29.160
Will we starve to death,
or will monsters kill us first?

19:29.160 --> 19:31.250
Either way, we're doomed.

19:31.250 --> 19:35.500
I just wanted to live
a normal life here.

19:36.630 --> 19:37.880
Just go home.

19:41.510 --> 19:43.510
What do you think you're doing?

19:43.510 --> 19:44.510
Earth Shift.

19:48.270 --> 19:52.270
Universal Garden, then Universal Seed!

19:58.150 --> 19:59.530
What?

19:59.820 --> 20:01.780
Next, the wall.

20:01.780 --> 20:02.820
Earth Shift!

20:06.780 --> 20:10.870
This should at least prevent
any more monsters from invading.

20:11.410 --> 20:14.040
Let me know if you need anything else.

20:14.040 --> 20:16.750
So please, don't give up.

20:17.550 --> 20:22.050
Don't brace yourself to die.
Brace yourself to live once more.

20:22.050 --> 20:25.800
Please! Please let me help you all!

20:30.470 --> 20:32.610
You want me to let you help us?

20:32.610 --> 20:34.480
I can't believe I heard
such strange remarks...

20:34.480 --> 20:36.060
...for the second time.

20:37.150 --> 20:40.570
The first was from the former lord,
Lord Nigun's father.

20:41.570 --> 20:44.200
It's over. We might as well just...

20:44.200 --> 20:46.240
Don't you dare give up!

20:46.240 --> 20:50.370
If you die, then I won't be
able to help you anymore!

20:50.370 --> 20:52.940
Live and let me help you all!

20:53.330 --> 20:54.790
He said...

20:54.790 --> 20:59.590
He was brave, kind,
and a funny man.

21:00.020 --> 21:03.260
This place only started falling apart
after Lord Nigun...

21:03.260 --> 21:06.510
No, after Nigun took over.

21:06.510 --> 21:09.600
Around that same time,
the Hydra showed up too.

21:09.600 --> 21:13.850
Nigun went and made
a contract with it on his own.

21:14.290 --> 21:18.610
The territory's defenses were reduced,
taxes were raised to the absolute limit...

21:18.610 --> 21:23.110
Everyone who was against it protested
and never came back.

21:23.610 --> 21:29.120
But thanks to you, Ein.
I feel like my faith has been restored.

21:29.580 --> 21:31.220
To have faith in hope.

21:34.220 --> 21:36.870
Yes! I won't let you down!

21:42.630 --> 21:44.880
What's wrong, Ein?

21:45.220 --> 21:46.680
Monsters...

21:46.680 --> 21:49.220
And it's a massive horde
coming straight for us!

21:54.930 --> 21:58.560
No matter how
many enemies there are...

21:58.560 --> 22:00.560
I'll defeat them all!

22:00.560 --> 22:03.650
I won't let a single one
lay a finger on this village!

22:09.660 --> 22:15.000
♪No matter what trials you face,
no reason to be in such a hurry♪

22:15.000 --> 22:20.000
♪The wind will never stop carrying on,
as long as you have faith in yourself♪

22:20.000 --> 22:22.420
♪Never give up, the future's just ahead♪

22:22.420 --> 22:25.510
♪Just like rock music that will never die♪

22:28.510 --> 22:30.470
♪Keep on, keep on strumming!♪

22:32.470 --> 22:37.230
♪There are only pointless things
I have to do on my list♪

22:37.230 --> 22:42.110
♪Even the sun of my burning heart
has now completely sank♪

22:42.110 --> 22:47.110
♪I have completely lost track
of my whereabouts♪

22:47.110 --> 22:51.910
♪I wonder where it goes
The very thing I once cherished♪

22:53.200 --> 22:55.660
♪I drowned in hustle and bustle♪

22:55.660 --> 22:57.120
♪In the midst of loneliness♪

22:57.120 --> 23:04.000
♪Every person is being
made aware of reality♪

23:05.880 --> 23:11.300
♪As I was reaching the out of reach
I wasn't sure if I saw a mirage♪

23:11.300 --> 23:15.970
♪As long as you have faith in yourself
The future is possible for you to change♪

23:15.970 --> 23:18.640
♪Even if rocks get in your way forward♪

23:18.640 --> 23:21.230
♪You must stick to your will
and see it through♪

23:21.230 --> 23:26.150
♪Even if, the worst, everything fails
There will definitely be another chance♪

23:26.150 --> 23:28.570
♪The only one to rival is yourself♪

23:28.570 --> 23:31.110
♪Always set your sights
on to rock 'n' goal!♪

23:31.110 --> 23:31.740
(Even Given)

23:31.740 --> 23:32.320
(the Worthless "Appraiser" Class,)

23:32.320 --> 23:32.530
(I'm)

23:32.530 --> 23:32.700
(Actually)

23:32.700 --> 23:32.820
(the Strongest)

23:35.870 --> 23:38.370
Next Episode: Uprising.

23:38.370 --> 23:40.370
(Next Episode: Uprising)
